      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name may honor Chatsworth House, the Duke of Devonshire’s estate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chatsworth%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1887, Chatsworth was the site of the Niagara Excursion disaster, the worst train wreck in Illinois history.",
